\image{conf-hkpolyu-sono-nanostructures.jpg}

\p{\strong{Caption.} Hollow silica nanostructures (\strong{HSN}) plus low-intensity ultrasound for \strong{precise, chronic, virus-free deep-brain neuromodulation}. The nanostructures give ultrasound a mechanosensitive target so stimulation localizes to injected regions; MRI/fiber-photometry confirmed stable signals for 2+ months and restored motor coordination in a Parkinson's mouse model with minimal toxicity. The mote/nanostructure-assisted end of the focused-ultrasound axis (cf. [[conf-kubanek-fus-pain]], landscape class [U]/[M] in [[bcf-0051]]).}
